      "title": "Expanding Images with Outpainting",
      "sourceHash": "f1e7233ed9233058c1fe65535d80afd8441c68c8a29c6b4fadbebf5215783db7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 3.053,
          "en": "As you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.053,
          "end": 5.88,
          "en": "images in DALL-E 2 always have a resolution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.88,
          "end": 10.68,
          "en": "of 1024 times 1024 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.68,
          "end": 15.06,
          "en": "Without painting, we can increase the image size,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.06,
          "end": 18.39,
          "en": "and we do this by not changing the resolution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.39,
          "end": 20.67,
          "en": "of the initial image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.67,
          "end": 24.81,
          "en": "Actually, we can expand the image by adding more content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.81,
          "end": 28.773,
          "en": "and therefore, the overall resolution also increases.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.76,
          "end": 32.52,
          "en": "We can either use out painting by going",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.52,
          "end": 37.263,
          "en": "to one of our recent images, for example, to this one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 38.28,
          "end": 42,
          "en": "and by now selecting the edit option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 42,
          "end": 47,
          "en": "And down here, move the generation frame.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 48.27,
          "end": 53.27,
          "en": "Alternatively, we can go back to our main menu,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 54.48,
          "end": 59.28,
          "en": "go to our profile and there open the editor.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 59.28,
          "end": 62.13,
          "en": "Now we have an empty editor so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 62.13,
          "end": 65.1,
          "en": "so we can first add a new prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 65.1,
          "end": 66.36,
          "en": "I just wanna have a new image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 66.36,
          "end": 69.15,
          "en": "that's why I'm following this approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 69.15,
          "end": 72.153,
          "en": "So let's say I wanna have an image of a dog.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 74.7,
          "end": 77.733,
          "en": "This will now be generated inside this frame.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 79.65,
          "end": 83.28,
